  "id": "vuln-quark-auto-save-ea8377a5",
  "pattern": "if $KEY not in $DONT_SAVE_KEYS:\n    ...",
  "pattern_not": [
    "if $KEY in $ALLOWED_KEYS:\n    ..."
  ],
  "languages": [
    "python"
  ],
  "message": "Detected insecure blacklist-based key validation that can be bypassed. The code uses a blacklist (dont_save_keys) instead of a whitelist (allowed_keys), which is vulnerable to batch assignment attacks. An attacker could inject keys not in the blacklist, leading to unauthorized data manipulation. Fix by switching to a whitelist approach where only explicitly allowed keys are processed.",
